   "feature": "house style guide (third-party use)",
   "claim": "Kobold Press ran a 'Designing with Style' series that explicitly 'breaks down the official 5th-edition style guide', quoting its Common Pitfalls section verbatim — evidence the guide was public and treated as canonical by third-party 5e designers.",
