  {
   "feature": "singular they (2013 vs 2018 policy)",
   "claim": "v1.04a forbids 'they'/'their' as singular pronouns except in dialogue; v1.08a reverses this 'in a departure from our past usage' but tells writers to rely on it only when no pleasing alternative exists.",
   "source": "Wizards of the Coast — D&D Style Guide: Writing and Editing, Version 1.08a (©2018, 'updated January 2019'; PDF mirror)",
