  "33": {
   "index": 33,
   "verdict": "PARTIAL",
   "trueWording": "Gygax was good at short punchy bits of detail",
   "note": "COMPLETENESS CRITIC §1: 'Seven VERBATIM rows carry a limb the verifier says is not on the page: ... [33] mechanics-with-narrative absent'. Verifier's own note: 'ONE sub-claim NOT supported: \"room text that mixes mechanics with narrative\" is nowhere on the page.'",
   "unsupportedLimb": "'room text that mixes mechanics with narrative' is nowhere on the page: the review names confusing information design and never discusses a mechanics/narrative blend or room/read-aloud text structure",
