   "note": "PDF fetched (200, 1.24MB) and text-extracted with pypdf; 9 pages read in full. Quote verbatim on p.5 (line-broken in the PDF, contiguous when whitespace-normalized). Every example in the claim is verbatim in 'Numerals in Rules Text' (pp.5-6): 'Anyone who touches the orb regains 3 hit points.'; 'The spell lasts for 1 round.'; 'The room is 20 feet square.'; and under 'But:' — 'the characters slept for six hours' and 'The two cities are fifty miles apart.' Page citation pp.5-6 is correct.",
