  },
  "737": {
   "index": 737,
   "verdict": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM",
   "trueWording": "That IS the goal of good writing.",
   "note": "Raw page fetched (HTTP 200). 'The Lions of Tell Arn Part 2 - The City & The City', posted July 6, 2026 by Bryce Lynch. The sentence immediately follows his description of a designer who called up a mental image, lived the room, and got it on paper so the reading DM can pick it up and run it as imagined. Transfer limb supported.",
