  "743": {
   "index": 743,
   "verdict": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM",
   "trueWording": "pads it like a school paper stretched to an assigned length",
   "note": "Raw page fetched (HTTP 200); the tag URL serves the full post 'How much description should a dungeon key include?', November 21, 2016, by David Hartlage. Quote verbatim in the section headed 'Longer descriptions', judging the 1989 Gamescience expanded Tegel Manor entry B9 BEDROOM against the shorter original. 'Expanded room description' and 'good middle sentence' limbs both on the page.",
