   "trueWording": "presents his dungeon ideas as part of a coherent adventure",
   "note": "Raw page fetched (HTTP 200). 'Part 46: \"Zenopus Built a Tower\"', Friday, February 6, 2015, section 'SAMPLE DUNGEON'. Page: the OD&D Sample Level is just a collection of examples whereas Holmes presents his dungeon ideas as part of a coherent adventure, almost a mini-setting. Both sides of the contrast are on the page. Attribution note: the post byline reads 'Zenopus Archives'; the name Zach Howard appears nowhere on the page (0 hits) and the Blogger profile does not render it, so the personal name rests on the source field, not this page.",
