   "trueWording": "monster stat blocks grew too big to comfortably fit within the paragraph",
   "note": "Raw page fetched (HTTP 200). Same post, section '1982 - Lost Caverns of Tsojcanth Publication' (heading precedes this paragraph; next heading is 1984). Delta writes that he finds it interesting to pinpoint in this one document the moment when monster stat blocks grew too big to comfortably fit within the paragraph text and had to move to a dedicated place. Locates-the-moment limb explicit.",
