   "verdict": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM",
   "trueWording": "a compact series of encounters appropriate for a specific level of play",
   "note": "Raw page fetched (HTTP 200). 'Dungeon Delve: WTF?', The Alexandrian. The sentence sits in an indented block (padding-left/right 60px in the HTML) among the passages Alexander quotes from the Dungeon Delve introduction, which he introduces as written by Bill Slavicsek, WotC Director of R&D. The block continues that the book holds 30 Delves, one per level, three encounters each. Definition and attribution limbs both supported.",
