   "trueWording": "The “where” is the opening scene, and the “why”…",
   "note": "Raw page fetched (HTTP 200, browser UA). Quote is word-for-word in the section 'You May Ask Yourself, How Did I Get Here?', which first poses the two reader questions (where am I / why am I here) that the claim maps onto scene and hook. Byline Shawn Merwin, D&D Beyond, Oct 23 2019, all confirmed on page.",
   "fromFile": "verdicts-dnd-i796-842.json"
