   "note": "Raw page fetched (HTTP 200). Quote verbatim, but it sits in the section 'Gaz 1 Part 2: Maps, Characters and More History of Karameikos', NOT 'Gaz 1 Part 4: The Lay of the Land' as the citation's page field says - same URL, wrong section; fix the locator before reuse. The claim's 'rather than the DM' is the contrast implied by 'mostly meant for players', not words on the page; the stated purpose there is letting players decide where their characters are from.",
