   "note": "PDF fetched (HTTP 200) and text-extracted with pypdf, 31 pages. Quote verbatim; the sentence names literary and media scholars, and it sits inside the paragraph that opens 'In the 2000s, scholars in fields such as sociology...', so the decade limb is carried by the paragraph frame. This is the White Rose accepted manuscript of the Routledge chapter.",
