  "818": {
   "index": 818,
   "verdict": "PARTIAL",
   "trueWording": "“independent authors like Peterson (2012) and Appelcline (2015)”",
   "note": "Same PDF, same page-region as index 817. Quote verbatim. Two nuances worth carrying: the chapter says 'like' Peterson and Appelcline, marking them as exemplars rather than the only producers, and its object is 'TRPGs and RPGs more generally', slightly wider than the claim's 'tabletop role-playing games'.",
   "unsupportedLimb": "the chapter says 'independent authors like Peterson (2012) and Appelcline (2015)', marking them as exemplars rather than the producers of the historiographies, and its object is 'TRPGs and RPGs more generally'",
