   "note": "Live wizards.com URL now 302s to the modern dnd.wizards.com shell (article gone), so this is the Wayback raw capture 20140530180347id_. Sentence stands in 'Undercover Insight #1: Boxed Text = MEGO'. Attribution to Noonan holds on the page: the byline is Decker and Noonan, the column is introduced as the design side, and the undercover narrator is named as Dave. The article also ranks this as the strongest of three factors ('the conversation vs. oration factor'), matching 'mechanism for the failure'.",
