   "trueWording": "No mechanics for this are offered, though",
   "note": "Quote is verbatim in the Bedlam section, where the reviewer generalises from Bedlam's mind-controlling winds to 'pretty much all of the special traits listed for these towns'. The reviewer explicitly declines the absolute, so a claim that gate-town special traits carry no mechanics overstates the source by one hedge. The substance (traits are flavour, meaning left to the DM) is otherwise supported.",
   "fromFile": "verdicts-dnd-i887-901.json"
  },
